[ti:Toota Ghada]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Folk & Regional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Ek chilam, ek baabaa, do ghade ka khel...
[00:18.03]Aaj maine ajab tamaashaa dekha
[00:28.06]Ek baabaa aur do ghade sang khel
[00:38.09]Toota ghada roya, aansu bahaaya
[00:48.12]Haye re mere baabaa, teri mehnat bekaar jaaye
[00:58.15]Baabaa bole – mat ro re deewaane
[01:08.18]Jo raste pe phool khile hain
[01:18.21]Wo teri boondon ke hai bahaane
[01:28.24]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[01:38.27]Main andha tha, ab aankhe khuli
[01:48.30]Mera chhed hi mera geet ban gaya
[01:58.33]Toota ghada gaaye, baabaa muskaaye
[02:08.36]Kuch bhi vyarth nahi jaaye
[02:18.39]Aaj nahi to kal wapas
[02:28.42]Nahi akaarth koi karm...
[02:38.45]Kal wapas...
